Python Strings & Tuples

This repository contains a Python practice assignment covering Strings and Tuples using Jupyter Notebook.

📌 Topics Covered
1. String Concatenation
Taking a name as input from the user
Concatenating two strings
Displaying the final message
2. String Slicing and Indexing

The assignment demonstrates how to:

Access the first character
Access the last character
Print the first 5 characters
Print the last 11 characters
Reverse a string
Extract the word "Python" using slicing
3. String Methods

The following Python string methods are practiced:

upper()
lower()
capitalize()
count()
replace()
4. Tuples

The assignment demonstrates:

Creating tuples
Concatenating two tuples
Repeating tuple elements
Accessing individual elements
Accessing elements using slicing
🛠️ Technologies Used
Python
Jupyter Notebook

🎯 Purpose

The purpose of this assignment is to understand and practice basic Python concepts related to string manipulation, indexing, slicing, string methods, and tuples.
